  "result": "The decision lives in `src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts`. The `mod` token resolves to Meta on Apple platforms and Control elsewhere, via `prefersMetaKey(platform)`, which tests the platform string against `/mac|iphone|ipad|ipod/i`. `matchesShortcut` then compares the parsed modifiers and key against the event's `ctrlKey`, `metaKey`, `altKey`, and `shiftKey`.\n\n`src/hooks/use-keyboard-shortcut.ts` is the caller. It reads `navigator.platform` and passes it into `matchesShortcut` on each `keydown`, but it does not make the matching decision itself.\n\nANSWER: src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts",
